OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly but largely sunny
OL,6,Fmorning with an early frost in places.
OL,7,FClouding over from the southeast from
OL,8,Flate morning with the odd spot of
OL,9,Flight rain possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy through the evening
OL,12,Fwith some patchy light rain possible.
OL,13,FStaying largely cloudy overnight with
OL,14,Ffurther outbreaks of light rain, but
OL,15,Fsome clearer spells may develop around
OL,16,Fthe Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
