OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy with rain at
OL,6,Ftimes, likely turning heavier and more
OL,7,Fpersistent later. Quite breezy around
OL,8,Fthe coasts. Best chance of any dry,
OL,9,Fbright weather towards the Isles.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FLargely cloudy on Wednesday with rain
OL,13,Fat times, brightening up later. Bright
OL,14,Fspells and some showers on Thursday.
OL,15,FBecoming rather wet and windy on
OL,16,FFriday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
